      "review_level": "full_owner_prefix_plus_exact_pinned_template_and_complete_residual_review",
      "assessment": "Carrier framing parses the carrier before optional history and synthetic diagnostics, preserves declared/undeclared status and explicitly reports zero-filled edge count. History load failures are intentionally suppressed to empty history, so no-antibodies and failed-history are observationally conflated. The emitted DDC carrier hash is a constant hash of carrier, not a binding to parsed topology/cochain. Synthetic SBE is delegated and not a mathematical correctness claim. Outcome exposes status directly and in narrative while top-level to_dict omits its dedicated field. Prefix and exact generated trailer fully covered; no history or diagnostic calls.",
